# Futrob architecture

Canonical sources: `docs/architecture/overview.md`, `module-boundaries.md`, `dependency-graph.md`, ADRs (esp. 0001, 0002, 0010), and `.cursor/skills/futrob-hexagonal-module/SKILL.md`.

## Shape

- Deployable Must: `apps/web` on Cloudflare Workers.
- Deployable previsto: `apps/api` (API de producto) consumiendo los mismos `@futrob/<bc>`.
- Business logic: `packages/<context>/` (`@futrob/<bc>`) = `domain` / `application` / ports.
- App slice: `apps/web/src/modules/<context>/` = `adapters` / `server` / `presentation` + facade `index.ts`.
- Composition **only** in `apps/web/src/di/` (with `bootstrap/`, `config/`, `context/` alongside).
- Shared: `@futrob/shared-kernel` + `apps/web/src/shared/` (infra web; domain reexports kernel).
- Queue/Cron thin handlers: `apps/web/src/workers/`.
- Do not nest composition under `src/app/` — that folder is removed.

MVP BCs: `identity`, `organizations`, `competitions`, `teams`, `scheduling`, `game-data`, `results`, `statistics`, `analytics`, `notifications`, `public-portal`.

## Dependency direction

```text
routes / UI → module/server → @futrob/<bc> application → domain + ports → adapters → D1/R2/Queues/HTTP
```

- Domain: no React, Zod, D1, fetch, Wrangler env, Sentry.
- Application: no concrete adapters.
- Package `index.ts`: no adapters, schemas DB, mappers, HTTP clients.
- Cross-module: package public API, bridges on ports, or outbox events — never foreign adapters/tables.

## Separation

```text
scheduling → when / how many
game-data  → provider observations (EA is an adapter)
results    → official selection / confirmation / disputes
statistics → standings / rankings from approved results only
analytics  → premium interpretation
```

## Cloudflare

- Persistence: D1. Blobs: R2. Jobs: Queues + Cron.
- Tenancy: application-scoped `organizationId` in adapters (no Postgres RLS).
- Better Auth for sessions; Futrob organizations for authorization.

## Imports and doc links

- TypeScript in web: prefer `@futrob/<bc>` for domain/application; `@/` for app-local paths (`apps/web/src/*`). Do not use `../` parent-relative imports across packages.
- Markdown in `docs/` and `product/`: link with repo-root absolute paths (`/docs/...`, `/product/...`), not `../`.
